Piskie browser automation runtime

This product contains source-adapted portions of chrome-devtools-mcp 1.10.1.
The adapted portions cover page/session identity and lifecycle, per-page
accessibility snapshots and UID lookup, action/navigation waiting, input/page
tool behavior, model tool schemas and result text, screenshot and script
observations, file output, console/network collection and formatting,
service-worker logs, source-mapped stacks, and issue descriptions/resources.

